stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> pending: 打开返工
  pending --> turn_granted: 授写入权并推送唤醒
  turn_granted --> wake_delivered: 体签收 或 交卷顺带证明
  pending --> wake_delivered: 替身带着返工内容启动
  wake_delivered --> completed: 节点交卷 关账
  pending --> pending: 目标体证死 同一事务换替身
  turn_granted --> pending: 目标体证死 同一事务换替身
  wake_delivered --> pending: 目标体证死 同一事务换替身
  pending --> returned_to_lead: 重试5次或换体3次用完
  turn_granted --> returned_to_lead: 重试5次或未知满2小时
  returned_to_lead --> pending: Lead 一键重投
  completed --> [*]
